{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Not all processing of animal products results in a price gain. This page lists the profitability of processing animal products at different quality levels and ",["l","耕种","Farming Professions"],"."]],["p",["Note that regular chicken ",["l","蛋","egg"],"s always produce normal quality ",["l","蛋黄酱","Mayonnaise"]," and ",["l","大鸡蛋","Large Egg"],"s produce gold quality mayonnaise. ",["l","鸭蛋黄酱","Duck Mayonnaise"],", ",["l","虚空蛋黄酱","Void Mayonnaise"],", and ",["l","恐龙蛋黄酱","Dinosaur Mayonnaise"]," are always normal quality. The quality of these eggs is not a factor. However, ",["l","鸵鸟蛋","Ostrich Eggs"]," produce 10 jars of ",["l","蛋黄酱","Mayonnaise"],", where the quality of the Mayonnaise will be equal to the quality of the Ostrich Egg used."]],["p",["Similarly, normal sized ",["l","牛奶","Milk"]," always produces normal quality ",["l","奶酪","Cheese"]," and ",["l","大壶牛奶","Large Milk"]," always produces gold quality Cheese. Normal sized ",["l","羊奶","Goat Milk"]," always produces normal quality ",["l","山羊奶酪","Goat Cheese"]," and ",["l","大瓶羊奶","Large Goat Milk"]," always produces gold quality Goat Cheese. The quality of the milk is not a factor."]],["p",["When using quality ",["l","动物毛","Wool"]," with a ",["l","织布机","Loom"],", there is a chance of receiving two ",["l","布料","Cloth"],":"]],["l",0,[[1,["Silver quality wool = 10% chance"]],[1,["Gold quality wool = 50% chance"]],[1,["Iridium quality wool = 100% chance"]]]],["p",["Mayonnaise produced using Ostrich Eggs and Cloth are the only artisan goods in the game that are actually affected by the quality level of the input."]]]],["When to process animal products",2,[["p",["Below is a quick reference table indicating when to process animal products, without regard to aging in ",["l","木桶","cask"],"s. Aging cheese or goat cheese in a cask will almost always result in profit. This table also does not take into account the chance of obtaining 2 ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," from 1 ",["l","动物毛","Wool"]," of gold quality. Obtaining 2 cloth from 1 wool is guaranteed only if the cloth is iridium quality. Looming a gold wool can result in a net loss if only 1 cloth is produced. However, in the long run the chance for extra cloth makes processing wool profitable on average for all quality levels (with iridium wool producing 2 cloth, gold 1.5 on average, and silver 1.1)."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Item"]},{"h":1,"v":["No Profession"]},{"h":1,"v":["Rancher"]},{"h":1,"v":["Artisan"]}],[[["l","蛋","Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["l","大鸡蛋","Large Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)442","Duck Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)305","Void Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)107","Dinosaur Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)107","Dinosaur Egg"]," with ",["i","(O)Book_Artifact","Treasure Appraisal Guide"]],["Never"],["Never"],["Regular"]],[[["i","(O)289","Ostrich Egg"]],["Always"],["Always"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)928","Golden Egg"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)440","Wool"]],["Regular, Silver, and Iridium"],["Regular, Silver, and Iridium"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)184","Milk"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)186","Large Milk"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)436","Goat Milk"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]],[[["l","大瓶羊奶","Large Goat Milk"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]],[[["i","(O)430","Truffle"]],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Regular, Silver, and Gold"],["Always"]]]]]],["Profit",2,[["p",["The table below shows the profit gained (or lost) from processing animal products through their respective ",["l","打造","Equipment"],". Gains less than 100%, which are losses, are highlighted in red."]],["p",["Profit Increase = (Processed Item Sell Price / Sell Price) × 100"]],["p",["Note that you may